    ],
    "text": "I,Munasinghe Kariyawasam Appuhamilage Don SomadasaGunawardena, Minister of Lands hereby declare, under Sub-section(1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land describedbelow is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under theprovisions of that Act.",
